      "cooked": "<p>Hi Everyone,<br>\nCould you please help me set the UOM conversion factor for the following details?</p>\n<p>Item Code:CUT-PIECE-1FTx7FT<br>\nItem Name: Cut Wood Piece (1ft x 7 ft)<br>\nStock UOM: Square foot<br>\nQuantity to Produce:2 Nos</p>\n<p>I’ve tried all possible configurations, but the result is still incorrect.</p>",
