      "created_at": "2025-09-25T05:31:34.586Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Sq ft (STOCK UOM) = 1<br>\nNos = 1/2</p>\n<p>Thumb Rule &gt; Upper (Stock UOM always 1 )<br>\n2nd conversion’s Value  will always be set as per following logic : how much the upper one fits in the lower one / lower one contains how many units of upper one.</p>\n<p>More explanation:</p>\n<p>1 sqft gives 2 nos as you said,<br>\nwhen sqft &gt; 1<br>\nnos &gt; half of 1 Sqft i.e. 1/2 <strong>&gt; 1 Nos contain half of upper value i.e 1 sqft</strong></p>",
